WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:44.960 --> 01:47.940
=Episode 2=

01:50.871 --> 01:52.004
Fei Ni, you're back?

01:52.140 --> 01:52.660
Mr. Zhou.

01:52.660 --> 01:52.970
Yeah.

01:54.810 --> 01:55.580
Fei Ni!

01:57.580 --> 01:58.370
Lin Mei.

01:58.370 --> 01:59.620
(Lin Mei)

01:59.970 --> 02:00.370
Let's go.

02:02.060 --> 02:02.610
Look.

02:02.610 --> 02:03.450
What's this?

02:04.020 --> 02:05.220
No one visits a patient

02:05.220 --> 02:06.170
and brings things back

02:06.170 --> 02:07.330
from the hospital like you.

02:07.330 --> 02:08.450
He can't eat it, anyway,

02:08.450 --> 02:10.137
so I brought it back
to let you try it.

02:10.820 --> 02:11.730
It's delicious.

02:12.450 --> 02:13.730
Let me show you something.

02:14.650 --> 02:15.540
This.

02:16.490 --> 02:17.490
Look.

02:21.100 --> 02:22.050
It's so big.

02:22.050 --> 02:23.270
How did you get this?

02:23.270 --> 02:24.580
Stealing from the tiger's mouth.

02:25.420 --> 02:26.690
I took it from my house.

02:26.880 --> 02:29.020
This won't do. Take it back.

02:29.020 --> 02:30.560
Or your brother
and your sister-in-law

02:30.560 --> 02:31.210
will devour you.

02:31.210 --> 02:32.160
It's fine.

02:32.300 --> 02:33.350
I still have this.

02:34.050 --> 02:34.800
I'm telling you.

02:35.350 --> 02:37.820
I've been secretly gathering
half a jin of meat tickets

02:37.820 --> 02:39.950
and five jin of national grain tickets
in the last two months.

02:39.970 --> 02:42.050
Send these to your brother as well.

02:46.930 --> 02:47.690
You're so nice.

02:49.450 --> 02:50.140
All right.

02:50.700 --> 02:52.260
I'll go to the post office tomorrow.

02:52.260 --> 02:54.730
I'll send all of these to my brother,

02:56.210 --> 02:58.100
so it won't take him too long

02:58.140 --> 03:00.860
to get your gift full of love.

03:01.730 --> 03:03.540
He will never appreciate my effort.

03:04.730 --> 03:05.800
Did you two argue again?

03:07.890 --> 03:09.350
Enough talk about us.

03:10.730 --> 03:11.490
Let me ask you.

03:12.860 --> 03:13.820
Well...

03:14.330 --> 03:15.210
That...

03:15.820 --> 03:16.730
Yang...

03:16.730 --> 03:17.650
Fang Muyang.

03:18.170 --> 03:19.380
His name doesn't matter.

03:20.020 --> 03:22.470
Anyway, can you really attend university

03:22.730 --> 03:24.190
if he wakes up?

03:28.140 --> 03:29.810
It's not guaranteed,

03:30.100 --> 03:32.840
but there's a 90% chance, at least.

03:33.160 --> 03:34.350
As long as he can wake up,

03:34.580 --> 03:36.271
I'll be a winner
for the rest of my life.

03:36.580 --> 03:37.980
What if he doesn't wake up?

03:38.930 --> 03:41.330
Knock on wood!

03:41.330 --> 03:41.890
Touch wood.

03:42.100 --> 03:43.380
- Touch wood.
- Touch wood.

03:43.380 --> 03:44.930
He will surely wake up. Say it.

03:44.930 --> 03:45.930
Say it.

03:45.930 --> 03:47.100
He will surely wake up.

03:47.100 --> 03:47.890
He must wake up.

03:47.890 --> 03:48.210
Yes.

03:48.210 --> 03:50.619
If he dares to stay asleep,
I'll pinch him until he wakes up.

03:50.620 --> 03:51.210
Pinch him here.

03:51.293 --> 03:52.470
Stop!

03:53.982 --> 03:55.880
Tomorrow, both of us
will go and pinch him.

03:55.880 --> 03:56.330
No!

03:56.330 --> 03:57.150
Pinch it here.

03:57.340 --> 03:59.650
- We'll pinch him here at the hospital.
- No!

04:02.020 --> 04:02.770
Seriously,

04:03.050 --> 04:05.030
if that hero really does wake up,

04:05.450 --> 04:06.950
you get to attend university,

04:07.350 --> 04:09.270
and your brother comes back
and we get married,

04:09.537 --> 04:11.440
isn't that three auspicious events
all at once?

04:15.490 --> 04:16.760
That day will come.

04:21.700 --> 04:23.780
(Jiangcheng Worker-Peasant Hospital)

04:33.020 --> 04:39.060
♪If the future cannot be touched♪

04:39.820 --> 04:43.060
♪Don't think too far ahead♪

04:43.060 --> 04:46.460
♪Just work hard for today♪

04:46.820 --> 04:50.100
♪Learn from the sun, how warm it is♪

04:50.770 --> 04:51.900
(The head nurse told me)

04:51.960 --> 04:53.960
(massaging improves your chances
of waking up.)

04:54.060 --> 04:55.770
(You must wake up quickly.)

04:57.020 --> 04:59.300
♪Will receive the most♪

05:00.540 --> 05:03.940
♪Live it real♪

05:04.020 --> 05:07.380
♪A down-to-earth life♪

05:07.700 --> 05:10.860
♪Slowly getting along with you♪

05:10.970 --> 05:12.180
Call me if the drip finishes.

05:14.540 --> 05:17.780
♪Live it real♪

05:17.860 --> 05:21.180
♪Two people, three meals, four seasons♪

05:21.540 --> 05:24.740
♪Collecting ordinary moments in life♪

05:24.820 --> 05:27.100
♪Making them into memories♪

05:42.260 --> 05:45.740
♪Live it real♪

05:45.780 --> 05:49.180
♪A down-to-earth life♪

05:49.540 --> 05:52.460
♪The cloudy days and rain along the way♪

05:52.460 --> 05:53.490
(Fei Ni...)

05:53.730 --> 05:55.620
(Think of this as a trial for you.)

05:56.140 --> 05:57.770
(Attending university is not easy.)

05:58.140 --> 05:59.020
Head Nurse!

05:59.420 --> 06:02.980
♪Two people, three meals, four seasons♪

06:03.060 --> 06:06.100
♪Collecting sweet moments in life♪

06:06.260 --> 06:08.540
♪Making them into memories♪

06:28.940 --> 06:31.060
Sorry. That wasn't on purpose.

06:43.260 --> 06:44.770
Seriously, this...

06:45.160 --> 06:47.580
Why did your skin become fair
after lying here for a month?

06:55.426 --> 06:57.382
When I pretended to sleep
when I was young,

06:57.850 --> 06:59.770
my brother would pull my eyelashes.

07:04.210 --> 07:05.090
Fang Muyang,

07:06.260 --> 07:08.210
I wish you were
just pretending to sleep.

07:15.300 --> 07:18.580
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory)

07:21.740 --> 07:22.330
How is it?

07:22.660 --> 07:23.530
Did anyone suspect us

07:23.530 --> 07:24.720
of what happened that day?

07:24.940 --> 07:26.960
I probed Ms. Liu thoroughly.

07:27.210 --> 07:28.530
It was chaotic that day.

07:28.530 --> 07:29.826
I don't think anyone noticed you.

07:30.060 --> 07:31.620
Moreover, it has been so long.

07:32.020 --> 07:32.850
Don't worry.

07:35.180 --> 07:36.140
I'm not afraid.

07:36.493 --> 07:38.204
We are officially in a relationship.

07:38.493 --> 07:40.020
We will get married sooner or later.

07:41.760 --> 07:44.648
We are not married as long as we
still haven't obtained the certificate.

07:44.770 --> 07:46.620
If they see us sleeping together,

07:46.620 --> 07:48.090
it'll be an ethical offense.

07:48.090 --> 07:49.804
It'll be all over for us! Do you get it?

07:49.890 --> 07:50.740
I get it.

07:52.290 --> 07:54.540
In the end, it was because
your parents looked down on me

07:54.560 --> 07:55.740
for being a normal factory worker

07:55.740 --> 07:57.910
who was not a good match
for a university graduate like you.

07:57.915 --> 08:00.410
If we get married, there's
no need for us to act sneakily.

08:01.140 --> 08:02.530
So, before we get married,

08:02.530 --> 08:05.871
you must get the quota from the factory
to recommend you to attend university.

08:09.500 --> 08:10.770
I'm not that capable.

08:11.850 --> 08:12.940
I still need to rely on you.

08:14.090 --> 08:15.260
Of course, I will help you.

08:16.260 --> 08:17.740
However, it's troublesome

08:17.782 --> 08:19.915
because the factory
only has one spot available.

08:20.137 --> 08:21.520
Fei Ni is also fighting for it.

08:22.310 --> 08:23.230
What should we do?

08:23.530 --> 08:24.330
In the end,

08:24.330 --> 08:26.180
I'm just not as qualified as Fei Ni.

08:26.620 --> 08:28.290
Why are you such a good-for-nothing?

08:30.090 --> 08:31.410
How are you worse than her?

08:31.530 --> 08:33.620
I'm sick of seeing
how self-righteous she is.

08:33.620 --> 08:35.040
She studies more than you, so what?

08:35.860 --> 08:36.740
"Clarity"?

08:37.100 --> 08:38.520
She just wants to embarrass me.

08:39.530 --> 08:40.520
Fang Muyang, too.

08:41.100 --> 08:42.250
If he wakes up

08:43.020 --> 08:44.050
and exposes us,

08:44.050 --> 08:45.260
we'll be doomed.

08:46.500 --> 08:47.140
No.

08:47.740 --> 08:48.890
I must think of something

08:48.890 --> 08:49.709
and make the factory

08:49.710 --> 08:51.910
decide who gets the university spot
as soon as possible.

08:52.050 --> 08:53.570
When everything has been decided,

08:53.860 --> 08:55.020
we'll be safe.

08:59.060 --> 09:05.300
(Jiangcheng Worker-Peasant Hospital)

09:05.460 --> 09:08.620
The head nurse asks me
to talk to you more.

09:08.620 --> 09:11.220
If you can hear me, you will hear me.

09:11.410 --> 09:13.782
If you can't, just think of it
as I'm talking to myself.

09:14.410 --> 09:16.440
The weather has become hot recently.

09:17.260 --> 09:18.690
I've changed your blanket for you.

09:19.260 --> 09:21.710
If you feel cold, just let me know.

09:25.620 --> 09:26.930
You can't tell me anyway.

09:27.890 --> 09:29.770
But I think you won't feel cold.

10:01.530 --> 10:02.410
Fang Muyang,

10:03.050 --> 10:04.210
did you draw this?

10:04.690 --> 10:06.220
You draw well.

10:11.170 --> 10:13.020
This is the Great Northern Wilderness.

10:16.410 --> 10:17.260
It's so pretty.

10:34.050 --> 10:35.410
There's so much money.

10:40.380 --> 10:41.170
Fang Muyang,

10:41.170 --> 10:43.410
do you remember
that you still owe me money?

10:46.182 --> 10:48.848
When you wake up,
I'll settle the score with you.

11:00.020 --> 11:06.340
(Inpatient Department)

11:12.800 --> 11:14.720
I finally found you.

11:15.100 --> 11:15.770
What is it?

11:15.770 --> 11:16.930
Is Fang Muyang awake?

11:16.930 --> 11:19.260
(Nurse Zhou)
No. Fang Muyang's family is here.

11:19.380 --> 11:20.380
Who?

11:20.380 --> 11:21.620
His girlfriend.

11:22.140 --> 11:23.380
His girlfriend?

11:24.170 --> 11:24.690
I've...

11:34.510 --> 11:35.100
Hello.

11:39.170 --> 11:41.170
(Ling Yi)
Hello, I am Ling Yi.

11:41.360 --> 11:43.137
- I'm Fang Muyang's...
- I know.

11:43.690 --> 11:45.140
You are Fang Muyang's girlfriend.

11:55.220 --> 11:58.580
(Office)

12:02.890 --> 12:03.460
Fei Ni,

12:03.460 --> 12:04.770
where's Fang Muyang's girlfriend?

12:04.804 --> 12:06.804
She's discussing his condition
with Dr. Liang.

12:10.620 --> 12:11.730
Listen to me, then.

12:11.730 --> 12:13.040
Since his girlfriend is here,

12:13.040 --> 12:14.290
send him away immediately.

12:15.460 --> 12:16.426
You don't understand?

12:16.930 --> 12:17.860
I'm only telling you

12:17.860 --> 12:18.860
all these things

12:18.860 --> 12:19.740
because you've been

12:19.930 --> 12:21.410
taking care of him all these days

12:21.410 --> 12:22.650
without slacking.

12:24.140 --> 12:26.140
A patient like Fang Muyang

12:26.140 --> 12:28.260
will usually sleep for a few years

12:28.500 --> 12:30.380
or even a few decades.

12:30.770 --> 12:32.382
In the past, the factory sent you here

12:32.404 --> 12:35.050
because he had no relatives
or friends to take care of him.

12:35.260 --> 12:37.220
Now that his girlfriend is here,

12:37.220 --> 12:38.690
you should send him away.

12:43.071 --> 12:44.850
You're already tired
from taking care of him.

12:49.460 --> 12:50.530
(This is bad.)

12:50.800 --> 12:52.760
(If Fang Muyang
doesn't need me anymore,)

12:53.570 --> 12:55.150
(what will happen to my quota?)

12:55.880 --> 12:57.140
(What about my university?)

13:05.100 --> 13:05.770
Fei Ni,

13:08.260 --> 13:09.460
can I have a talk with you?

13:23.071 --> 13:25.590
I only found out he was injured
after reading the newspaper.

13:26.218 --> 13:27.188
I didn't expect him

13:28.137 --> 13:29.471
to be so seriously injured.

13:30.570 --> 13:32.510
Fang Muyang is a lot better now.

13:32.840 --> 13:33.930
Waking up

13:34.410 --> 13:35.690
is just a matter of time.

13:41.930 --> 13:44.170
Are you from the same school
as Fang Muyang?

13:45.360 --> 13:46.530
We were classmates for a year

13:46.530 --> 13:47.890
in middle school.

13:49.500 --> 13:50.740
No wonder you look familiar.

13:53.460 --> 13:54.610
I heard the head nurse say

13:54.610 --> 13:56.500
you've been the one
taking care of Fang Muyang.

13:56.760 --> 13:58.350
I thank you on behalf of Fang Muyang.

14:00.650 --> 14:03.220
(Is she going to shake my hand
and take over the duties from me?)

14:12.620 --> 14:13.280
You're welcome.

14:15.650 --> 14:16.410
You...

14:19.690 --> 14:21.140
(Don't say it.)

14:21.650 --> 14:23.740
(Don't say that you no longer need me.)

14:25.570 --> 14:26.570
(Don't say it...)

14:27.382 --> 14:29.204
How long can you take care of him?

14:32.460 --> 14:33.460
Can I ask you to help me

14:33.460 --> 14:34.810
take care of him for a while?

14:35.220 --> 14:36.860
Since you were his classmates.

14:37.760 --> 14:40.182
No problem. I can take care of him
for as long as you need.

14:40.182 --> 14:40.782
No.

14:41.770 --> 14:42.770
I mean...

14:43.260 --> 14:44.460
Fang Muyang is injured

14:44.460 --> 14:46.248
because he saved our factory's worker.

14:46.248 --> 14:49.170
So, it's only right for me to take
care of him on behalf of the factory.

14:50.860 --> 14:51.570
That's great.

14:53.740 --> 14:55.780
I'll be leaving after I get my luggage.

14:56.100 --> 14:57.700
You're already leaving?

14:58.260 --> 15:00.020
I just came back
from an interview abroad.

15:00.020 --> 15:02.170
I still need to write up an article
after I return to university.

15:02.182 --> 15:03.782
I'll come and visit him when I'm free.

15:05.020 --> 15:05.980
University?

15:06.500 --> 15:07.060
Are you

15:07.140 --> 15:08.610
enrolled in a university?

15:10.650 --> 15:11.880
The production team had a spot

15:11.880 --> 15:13.380
to enroll in the university last year.

15:13.740 --> 15:14.220
They...

15:14.930 --> 15:16.340
They gave me the spot.

15:18.980 --> 15:19.650
Congratulations.

15:33.770 --> 15:34.570
Fei Ni,

15:34.570 --> 15:35.620
what's going on?

15:35.620 --> 15:37.937
Why did his girlfriend
leave with all her luggage?

15:38.460 --> 15:41.530
She said she'd be back in a few days.

15:42.537 --> 15:44.650
It seems like
you'll be stuck here for a while.

15:45.930 --> 15:48.890
Zhou, do you have any other method

15:49.340 --> 15:51.170
to let him wake up sooner?

15:51.460 --> 15:53.530
I have no idea.

15:54.100 --> 15:56.340
Didn't the head nurse ask you

15:56.340 --> 15:57.620
to chat more with him

15:59.170 --> 15:59.980
or let him

15:59.980 --> 16:01.937
listen to some music
that he liked in the past?

16:02.170 --> 16:03.140
Music?

16:03.530 --> 16:04.690
It might be useful.

16:04.782 --> 16:06.100
What about revolutionary operas?

16:06.604 --> 16:08.004
As long as it has a tune.

16:30.980 --> 16:32.200
This is your father's treasure.

16:33.271 --> 16:35.170
It's difficult
to find this second-hand radio.

16:35.170 --> 16:36.080
Don't spoil it.

16:36.570 --> 16:37.710
Don't worry, Mom.

16:37.893 --> 16:39.604
It'll be around
as long as I'm still alive.

16:40.826 --> 16:42.160
You go to work at night

16:42.182 --> 16:44.226
and still need to go to the hospital
during the day.

16:44.226 --> 16:45.290
Can't you take a break?

16:45.650 --> 16:47.050
Do you think you're made from steel?

16:47.050 --> 16:48.650
We'll change shifts tomorrow.

16:48.650 --> 16:50.410
They want this batch of goods urgently.

16:50.410 --> 16:51.460
We need to rush it.

16:51.460 --> 16:52.620
If the delivery is delayed,

16:52.620 --> 16:54.026
we'll have to pay a compensation.

16:55.620 --> 16:57.290
We still have food on the table.

16:57.740 --> 16:59.620
Do you think you have too much money?

17:01.740 --> 17:03.740
Liu, who lives downstairs,

17:04.020 --> 17:05.850
is also kind-hearted. She thinks

17:06.090 --> 17:07.570
my daughter is very pretty

17:07.570 --> 17:08.610
and needs a partner.

17:08.610 --> 17:09.315
Coincidentally,

17:09.320 --> 17:11.570
- the clothing factory has a man...
- Mom, I don't want a partner.

17:11.570 --> 17:13.090
Just leave me alone.

17:13.940 --> 17:15.980
Having money is the most important.

17:17.570 --> 17:19.460
Fine. Don't sleep too late.

17:27.090 --> 17:30.290
Fang Muyang, this is enough.

17:30.570 --> 17:32.420
You've been lying here
for more than a month.

17:32.420 --> 17:34.493
If you don't wake up,
I'll stop taking care of you.

17:37.900 --> 17:40.110
I really owe you in my previous life.

17:41.260 --> 17:44.050
I'm not trying to scare you.

17:44.260 --> 17:45.420
If you don't wake up,

17:45.420 --> 17:46.850
you'll even lose your girlfriend.

17:47.330 --> 17:49.260
She hasn't been here
since her last visit.

17:51.660 --> 17:53.940
I'm not trying to sow discord

17:53.940 --> 17:55.050
but I just want to say

17:55.050 --> 17:57.293
that it'll be good for both of us
if you wake up sooner.

18:09.900 --> 18:11.460
You listen to this play the whole day.

18:11.460 --> 18:13.570
My ears are going to burst from this.

18:13.900 --> 18:15.900
Any more and I will
be able to do the play myself.

18:29.020 --> 18:30.700
It's out of battery.

18:55.130 --> 18:56.370
You force me to do this.

19:13.900 --> 19:15.570
This is your book.

19:16.260 --> 19:17.660
I didn't want to do this

19:17.660 --> 19:18.940
because it was too dangerous.

19:18.940 --> 19:20.130
Right now,

19:20.330 --> 19:22.130
I have no other choice.

19:22.130 --> 19:23.740
I'll read a few pages for you.

19:23.900 --> 19:26.460
However, you mustn't report me
when you wake up.

19:26.460 --> 19:27.982
Otherwise, my role model will be gone.

19:39.610 --> 19:44.530
We hope beautiful lives
can keep spreading.

19:44.740 --> 19:45.460
That is how

19:46.290 --> 19:49.230
the beautiful roses will forever exist.

19:49.660 --> 19:51.360
If mature things

19:51.670 --> 19:53.360
must cease to exist in the world,

19:53.940 --> 19:57.700
the beautiful descendants will
continue to spread fragrance.

20:09.500 --> 20:13.680
However, you are engaged
with the sparkling eyes of yours.

20:14.960 --> 20:17.760
Fei Ni, it's me. Open the door.

20:18.700 --> 20:20.180
Coming.

20:26.330 --> 20:27.460
Are you wiping him down?

20:28.004 --> 20:29.420
It's time to take your temperature.

20:36.804 --> 20:39.560
Why don't you take his temperature
after you finish wiping him down?

20:40.810 --> 20:41.700
Sure.

20:45.420 --> 20:46.550
I'll help you close the door.

20:46.550 --> 20:47.190
Thank you.

20:53.850 --> 20:55.270
Fang Muyang, seriously.

20:55.293 --> 20:57.350
You're causing me trouble
even if you're lying here.

21:08.390 --> 21:09.090
Fei Ni!

21:09.500 --> 21:10.050
Fei Ni!

21:11.200 --> 21:12.480
Fei Ni!

21:12.871 --> 21:15.490
The shortlist of the factory's
recommended university candidates

21:15.493 --> 21:16.220
is announced!

21:16.390 --> 21:17.580
Go and take a look!

21:32.940 --> 21:36.204
(University shortlisted candidates)

21:36.226 --> 21:39.740
(Chen Guodong,
Zhang Xiangyang, Wang Defa)

21:42.700 --> 21:44.620
(Study)

21:45.404 --> 21:46.740
Is everything ready over there?

21:46.740 --> 21:47.937
Everything's ready, Ms. Xu.

21:48.090 --> 21:51.180
Ms. Xu, isn't it still early until the
beginning of the university semester?

21:51.180 --> 21:52.940
Why is the name list released so soon?

21:52.940 --> 21:54.420
Isn't it too early?

21:54.420 --> 21:56.090
I also thought it was too early.

21:56.090 --> 21:58.130
However, Feng Lin was right.

21:58.130 --> 22:01.050
It's better to make a decision
on something so important earlier.

22:01.050 --> 22:03.260
I haven't completed the assessment yet.

22:05.090 --> 22:05.850
What do you mean?

22:07.740 --> 22:09.660
I mean...

22:10.530 --> 22:12.940
I've been taking care of Fang Muyang,

22:12.940 --> 22:15.090
so I didn't pay attention
to the factory...

22:15.090 --> 22:15.980
Fei,

22:15.980 --> 22:17.660
this is the right thing to do.

22:18.850 --> 22:20.570
Your most important task right now

22:20.570 --> 22:22.940
is to take good care of Fang Muyang.

22:24.050 --> 22:24.980
Don't worry.

22:25.182 --> 22:27.360
You'll surely get your chance
in the future.

22:27.537 --> 22:28.460
You understand, right?

22:59.850 --> 23:00.610
Fang Muyang,

23:03.090 --> 23:05.660
do you understand
why I must attend university?

23:11.180 --> 23:12.090
I'm sure you can't.

23:13.770 --> 23:16.090
Not even my parents can understand.

23:18.660 --> 23:20.700
They've been factory workers forever.

23:22.760 --> 23:25.360
They think there's nothing wrong
with being a factory worker.

23:31.290 --> 23:32.180
My brother

23:33.050 --> 23:34.220
and Lin Mei

23:34.648 --> 23:35.900
can't understand as well.

23:38.050 --> 23:39.420
They think

23:40.740 --> 23:43.740
there's no difference between
going to university and being a worker.

23:45.850 --> 23:46.700
But I know...

23:52.220 --> 23:52.980
It's different.

23:55.220 --> 23:56.760
I like to read books.

23:57.830 --> 23:59.330
I like to write.

24:00.420 --> 24:03.050
But I know I'm still incapable.

24:03.660 --> 24:05.330
That is why I want to attend university.

24:05.330 --> 24:07.940
I want to read more books.
I want to learn how to write.

24:07.940 --> 24:10.570
I want to become an author
like Shakespeare.

24:19.290 --> 24:20.500
I dare not

24:21.460 --> 24:23.210
say these things to other people.

24:24.330 --> 24:26.490
They will surely think
that I've gone mad.

24:32.626 --> 24:34.050
In order to attend university,

24:34.050 --> 24:36.260
I'm willing to go through
all kinds of suffering.

24:36.260 --> 24:38.740
However, they just wouldn't let me go.

24:40.940 --> 24:42.790
I just don't get it.

24:43.020 --> 24:45.550
Why do people like Feng Lin,
who doesn't even know the term

24:45.550 --> 24:46.940
that means pure and clear,

24:46.940 --> 24:48.090
can attend university,

24:48.090 --> 24:48.970
but I can't

24:49.660 --> 24:51.870
even get a recommendation spot?

24:54.050 --> 24:55.700
I didn't even dare to say that.

24:58.180 --> 25:01.420
Because Ms. Xu might say
that I'm not being humble.

25:02.130 --> 25:02.920
But

25:04.260 --> 25:06.540
can I attend university
just by being humble?

25:16.290 --> 25:18.380
If the college entrance examination
still exists,

25:18.720 --> 25:20.230
I'll surely qualify for it,

25:20.610 --> 25:22.110
but it no longer exists

25:22.800 --> 25:25.270
so I can't decide my own fate.

25:26.520 --> 25:29.800
Fang Muyang, I'm not greedy at all.

25:30.330 --> 25:31.020
I just

25:31.020 --> 25:31.610
don't want

25:31.610 --> 25:34.315
to live every day of my life
knowing what will happen at the end.

25:35.940 --> 25:37.250
I beg you.

25:40.050 --> 25:41.248
Wake up.

26:07.500 --> 26:08.680
Why are you crying?

26:19.130 --> 26:20.130
Fang Muyang,

26:23.250 --> 26:24.090
you're awake.

26:25.090 --> 26:25.880
Fang Muyang.

26:28.420 --> 26:29.570
Who are you?

26:32.500 --> 26:33.530
I am Fei Ni.

26:37.130 --> 26:37.980
Fei Ni.

26:39.900 --> 26:40.700
Fei Ni.

26:48.180 --> 26:49.020
Fei Ni.

26:50.380 --> 26:53.780
(Inpatient Department)

26:59.090 --> 27:00.220
We will only know

27:00.220 --> 27:02.570
the detailed results
after his brain scan is completed.

27:02.740 --> 27:04.700
However, from his reaction,

27:04.700 --> 27:05.740
the blood clot in the brain

27:05.740 --> 27:07.160
seems to be absorbing quite well.

27:07.160 --> 27:08.370
Moreover, his motor functions

27:08.370 --> 27:09.382
seem to be working well.

27:09.382 --> 27:10.850
Thank you, Dr. Liang.

27:11.260 --> 27:12.290
Fang Muyang,

27:12.330 --> 27:13.700
while you were in a coma,

27:13.700 --> 27:15.420
Fei Ni had been
the one taking care of you.

27:15.570 --> 27:17.050
It's all thanks to her

27:17.050 --> 27:18.293
that you can wake up so soon.

27:18.330 --> 27:20.130
- Yes.
- You need to thank her well.

27:20.982 --> 27:21.950
What is this place?

27:23.260 --> 27:23.610
This...

27:24.420 --> 27:26.500
This is the hospital.

27:27.090 --> 27:29.050
You saved someone
and got injured because of it.

27:29.420 --> 27:30.590
Don't you remember?

27:32.700 --> 27:35.050
Do you still remember what your name is

27:35.071 --> 27:36.382
and where you come from?

27:52.180 --> 27:55.740
(Jiangcheng Worker-Peasant Hospital)

27:57.330 --> 27:58.260
Fang Muyang,

27:58.900 --> 28:02.090
not only are you a morally noble person,

28:02.530 --> 28:04.610
but you are also a resolute person.

28:04.610 --> 28:06.248
All of Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory

28:06.315 --> 28:08.500
are happy to see you out of the coma.

28:08.500 --> 28:09.770
Does he not remember anything,

28:09.770 --> 28:10.740
including his name,

28:10.740 --> 28:11.460
where he lives,

28:11.537 --> 28:12.620
and who his parents are?

28:14.130 --> 28:15.090
Dr. Liang says

28:15.090 --> 28:17.290
he is suffering from retrograde amnesia

28:17.290 --> 28:19.980
resulting from a moderate
closed traumatic brain injury.

28:20.420 --> 28:21.330
It means

28:21.330 --> 28:23.940
he has forgotten
his basic living capabilities.

28:24.090 --> 28:25.940
Doesn't that mean
he has turned into an idiot?

28:27.500 --> 28:29.530
Such a handsome idiot. What a pity.

28:29.850 --> 28:32.260
How is he an idiot?

28:32.260 --> 28:35.330
Dr. Liang said

28:35.420 --> 28:36.940
he needs time

28:37.260 --> 28:38.260
to recover slowly.

28:38.260 --> 28:39.050
For how long?

28:39.260 --> 28:40.740
I don't know.

28:42.026 --> 28:43.493
It's the same as saying nothing.

28:47.090 --> 28:47.840
Hold on.

28:48.610 --> 28:49.740
Does it mean he has forgotten

28:49.740 --> 28:51.080
about you taking care of him?

28:51.270 --> 28:52.560
You've lost out on so much, then.

28:54.050 --> 28:55.820
I just need Ms. Xu to remember.

29:01.610 --> 29:02.740
Fang Muyang,

29:03.660 --> 29:04.720
do you still remember me?

29:08.210 --> 29:08.970
Fei Ni?

29:09.700 --> 29:10.940
I am not Fei Ni.

29:11.670 --> 29:13.080
You saved me.

29:14.370 --> 29:15.340
Do you not remember?

29:20.130 --> 29:21.260
It's fine.

29:22.020 --> 29:23.130
Fang Muyang,

29:24.220 --> 29:26.330
I contacted your mill.

29:26.660 --> 29:28.940
You are a model individual over there.

29:28.940 --> 29:30.740
An example that everyone can learn from.

29:30.740 --> 29:33.810
If you have any problems in the future,

29:34.130 --> 29:35.420
you can come to me.

29:37.370 --> 29:37.900
Fei Ni.

29:39.660 --> 29:40.610
Of course.

29:41.490 --> 29:42.970
Fei Ni, as well.

29:43.740 --> 29:44.810
Fei Ni,

29:44.980 --> 29:46.700
you've worked hard.

29:46.850 --> 29:47.770
Fang Muyang

29:47.770 --> 29:49.700
kept mentioning your name just now.

29:49.700 --> 29:52.360
It's obvious that you've spent
a lot of effort during this period.

29:52.850 --> 29:54.180
Not at all, Ms. Xu.

29:54.810 --> 29:56.020
I've decided

29:56.020 --> 29:57.530
to get someone

29:57.660 --> 29:59.180
to write both of your stories

29:59.180 --> 30:00.330
after he recovers completely.

30:00.850 --> 30:03.660
I will report it
in front of every employee

30:03.660 --> 30:05.248
before making a report to the superior.

30:05.420 --> 30:06.300
I also want to call

30:06.500 --> 30:08.560
every worker
from every industry and system

30:08.900 --> 30:10.160
to learn from both of you.

30:10.980 --> 30:13.600
When the time comes,
not only the role model in the factory,

30:14.500 --> 30:16.080
but I'll also recommend you

30:16.080 --> 30:17.630
to become the whole city's role model.

30:18.330 --> 30:20.330
Ms. Xu, there's no need.

30:20.330 --> 30:21.900
I understand.

30:22.330 --> 30:24.050
Taking care of a patient like this

30:24.050 --> 30:25.810
is hard work.

30:25.980 --> 30:26.700
Don't worry.

30:27.130 --> 30:29.330
I can see the effort you've put in.

30:29.900 --> 30:31.510
The factory's superior sees it too.

30:32.180 --> 30:34.090
When you become the city's role model,

30:34.182 --> 30:36.160
you'll be able
to attend any university you want.

30:38.220 --> 30:38.900
Really?

30:41.137 --> 30:42.980
Thank you for
your recognition, Ms. Xu.

30:43.330 --> 30:47.940
Of course, he must
make a full recovery first.

30:49.460 --> 30:50.810
Don't worry, Ms. Xu.

30:50.810 --> 30:52.700
I will never give up halfway.

30:52.740 --> 30:54.660
I will surely
take good care of Fang Muyang

30:54.660 --> 30:56.570
and see that he makes a full recovery.

30:57.260 --> 31:00.090
Then, I'll leave him to you.

31:00.660 --> 31:01.530
Don't worry.

31:07.330 --> 31:09.330
What did Ms. Xu mean?

31:10.610 --> 31:12.130
She means

31:12.660 --> 31:14.810
if Fang Muyang
can have his memory restored,

31:14.850 --> 31:17.810
I will have a chance
to attend university!

31:29.740 --> 31:31.200
You drew this whole book.

31:31.460 --> 31:32.360
Take a good look.

31:32.626 --> 31:33.850
Stop adjusting the dial.

31:36.410 --> 31:38.770
Look at this. A lumber mill.

31:39.460 --> 31:39.850
Look.

31:42.940 --> 31:44.330
Look at this crane.

31:44.330 --> 31:45.471
I'm sure you remember this.

31:45.493 --> 31:46.180
I don't.

31:47.570 --> 31:48.420
This.

31:48.420 --> 31:50.260
Is this Ling Yi? Take a good look.

31:50.610 --> 31:51.500
I don't know.

31:52.260 --> 31:53.530
Ling Yi.

31:53.530 --> 31:54.330
Right?

31:54.330 --> 31:55.260
Take a good look.

31:56.660 --> 31:57.500
This...

31:58.290 --> 31:59.090
Take a look.

32:00.090 --> 32:01.471
Do you remember them?

32:01.850 --> 32:02.990
They are your colleagues.

32:03.940 --> 32:05.080
Can you remember?

32:05.530 --> 32:07.260
I don't remember. I don't know.

32:15.660 --> 32:16.250
Eat this.

32:16.500 --> 32:18.400
The doctor says
it's good for your brain.

32:30.810 --> 32:31.660
Fang Muyang,

32:31.660 --> 32:33.610
why do you always look at the watch?

32:34.420 --> 32:36.660
Does it mean something special?

32:40.770 --> 32:42.740
Was it given to you by your parents

32:42.900 --> 32:44.570
or your grandmother?

32:55.180 --> 32:55.790
Keep eating.

33:02.537 --> 33:04.582
Two sticks a day.
One in the morning, one at night.

33:15.360 --> 33:16.650
Do you still remember this?

33:17.330 --> 33:18.630
You sold it to me for 1.5 yuan

33:19.290 --> 33:20.820
at the canola field.

33:21.610 --> 33:22.660
Open it.

33:27.030 --> 33:28.250
A book by Shakespeare.

33:28.660 --> 33:31.430
You could even recite his "Sonnet 14".

33:38.330 --> 33:39.940
Didn't you learn how to draw?

33:39.940 --> 33:43.020
You collected all these
famous paintings from around the world.

34:14.730 --> 34:16.800
It's good for restoring your memory.

34:20.710 --> 34:21.330
Eat.

34:29.300 --> 34:30.430
Take a big bite.

34:46.170 --> 34:47.780
Help!

34:47.980 --> 34:49.610
The house is collapsing!

34:56.610 --> 34:59.460
Ms. Liu, who saved you?

34:59.460 --> 35:03.170
It's that young man. Thank you.

35:07.690 --> 35:08.820
It's all right.

35:08.820 --> 35:10.500
Everyone, wake everyone up!

35:10.500 --> 35:11.980
Stop sleeping!

35:11.980 --> 35:14.340
It will collapse again!

35:14.860 --> 35:17.460
Wake everyone up! Stop sleeping!

35:18.200 --> 35:20.030
Mom, I'm scared.

35:20.940 --> 35:22.230
What should we do?

35:22.530 --> 35:25.170
The tree is going to fall on the house!

35:26.340 --> 35:29.530
Who is it? It's still that young man!

35:29.530 --> 35:32.500
He has already saved four people.

35:32.500 --> 35:34.980
Four people!

35:38.460 --> 35:39.570
Do you remember?

35:43.690 --> 35:44.610
Fang Muyang,

35:47.170 --> 35:48.900
I've been waiting for this weather

35:48.900 --> 35:50.650
for half a month.

35:50.650 --> 35:52.650
I heard my father say

35:52.650 --> 35:54.300
the weather was similar that night.

35:54.300 --> 35:55.980
There was a heavy storm.

35:56.170 --> 35:57.980
You saved three people.

35:57.980 --> 35:59.940
Then, the house collapsed

35:59.940 --> 36:00.980
and the tree fell.

36:00.980 --> 36:02.610
You ran inside quickly.

36:07.090 --> 36:08.130
What next?

36:09.130 --> 36:11.500
After that, you were lying here.

36:15.340 --> 36:16.170
I don't remember.

36:21.650 --> 36:22.530
It's all right.

36:23.980 --> 36:24.980
I'll keep thinking.

36:26.340 --> 36:27.710
There must be other ways.

36:39.170 --> 36:39.760
Fei Ni.

36:42.980 --> 36:44.137
I will work hard.

36:53.780 --> 36:54.860
That's good enough.

37:01.260 --> 37:04.980
(Jiangcheng Worker-Peasant Hospital)

37:12.460 --> 37:13.490
What is he doing?

37:14.050 --> 37:14.890
Playing the piano.

37:15.050 --> 37:16.404
He has been playing it for days.

37:17.050 --> 37:17.870
Playing the piano?

37:18.980 --> 37:20.420
You are an expert in piano.

37:20.420 --> 37:21.780
Go and teach him.

37:22.090 --> 37:23.300
Stop teasing me.

37:26.020 --> 37:27.120
How has he been recently?

37:27.137 --> 37:28.620
Has his memory recovered a little?

37:31.693 --> 37:33.070
Are you sure you want to do this?

37:33.780 --> 37:34.890
Taking care of an idiot

37:35.170 --> 37:37.200
is harder than taking care
of a patient in a coma.

37:37.610 --> 37:38.570
I'll say it again.

37:38.570 --> 37:41.200
He's not an idiot.
He just forgets things.

37:42.380 --> 37:43.230
You are right.

37:43.690 --> 37:44.490
He is not an idiot.

37:44.940 --> 37:45.950
You are the idiot.

37:47.500 --> 37:48.100
Fei Ni,

37:48.690 --> 37:49.960
you must listen to me this time.

37:50.380 --> 37:52.310
This is a trap.
Stop sinking deeper into it.

37:54.380 --> 37:56.160
Ms. Xu said

37:57.090 --> 37:58.860
that if I can take good care of him,

37:58.990 --> 38:00.782
she will recommend me
to attend university.

38:00.930 --> 38:02.450
I can't just give up so easily.

38:02.980 --> 38:04.170
What if he can't recover?

38:04.820 --> 38:05.280
Well,

38:05.980 --> 38:07.650
people also said he couldn't wake up

38:07.650 --> 38:09.210
but he still woke up.

38:12.090 --> 38:15.370
Fei Ni, if you can't do it this year,
there's always next year.

38:15.380 --> 38:17.730
If you can't do it next year,
there's always the year after next.

38:17.737 --> 38:19.826
This is not the only way
to attend university.

38:23.720 --> 38:24.780
Lin Mei,

38:25.530 --> 38:26.670
you know. I...

38:27.500 --> 38:29.160
I've been working hard for three years.

38:30.050 --> 38:31.540
I know very well

38:32.020 --> 38:33.310
that every failure

38:33.460 --> 38:35.300
makes me less determined.

38:35.780 --> 38:38.650
I don't know if I still have the courage
to fight for it next year.

38:39.250 --> 38:41.210
I don't want to see my determination

38:41.380 --> 38:42.860
being worn away little by little.

38:45.004 --> 38:46.448
Do you think I don't know you?

38:47.250 --> 38:47.980
You will

38:48.570 --> 38:50.240
only give up when you hit a wall.

38:50.980 --> 38:51.520
No.

38:51.560 --> 38:53.210
You won't give up
even if you hit a wall.

38:56.050 --> 38:58.000
Who knows
when he will regain his memory?

39:00.090 --> 39:00.740
Oh,

39:01.210 --> 39:03.570
doesn't he have
any relatives or friends?

39:07.420 --> 39:09.250
He does have one.

39:10.050 --> 39:12.740
Perhaps it might work if she's here.

39:17.020 --> 39:17.780
Where is he?

39:18.500 --> 39:19.030
Fei Ni.

39:25.210 --> 39:26.170
You're still smiling?

39:26.190 --> 39:28.570
You're an adult, but you can't even
tie your own shoelaces.

39:28.570 --> 39:29.226
Come here.

39:35.090 --> 39:36.190
Just leave it here.

39:37.570 --> 39:38.080
Squat down.

39:40.020 --> 39:42.090
It might be hard,
but you still need to learn it.

39:42.750 --> 39:43.630
Tie a knot.

39:44.780 --> 39:45.640
Make it into a circle.

39:46.404 --> 39:48.648
Why are you looking at me?
Look at your shoes.

39:51.020 --> 39:51.650
Turn it around.

39:52.020 --> 39:52.860
Tie it tightly.

39:53.860 --> 39:54.830
He might be a fool,

39:54.848 --> 39:56.360
but he's easy to take care of.

40:10.690 --> 40:11.500
Fang Muyang.

40:22.690 --> 40:23.820
You're here.

40:27.820 --> 40:28.900
Ling Yi.

40:29.780 --> 40:31.090
She's here to see you.

40:31.090 --> 40:32.780
Quick. Take a good look at her.

40:33.050 --> 40:34.650
Can you remember anything?

40:35.210 --> 40:36.020
Fang Muyang,

40:36.570 --> 40:38.090
have you really forgotten about me?

40:38.420 --> 40:40.070
I am Ling Yi...

40:46.380 --> 40:47.648
Stop wasting your energy.

40:48.170 --> 40:49.430
He doesn't even remember me.

40:49.430 --> 40:50.340
(Fang Mujing)

40:51.550 --> 40:53.120
Jing, you're here too.

40:58.570 --> 40:59.780
You must be Fei Ni.

41:02.170 --> 41:03.500
Hello, I am Fang Mujing.

41:03.980 --> 41:05.080
I am Fang Muyang's sister.

41:08.800 --> 41:09.540
Hello, Mujing.

41:26.680 --> 41:27.360
Fei Ni.

41:27.715 --> 41:29.737
Thank you
for taking care of Fang Muyang.

41:30.730 --> 41:31.780
You don't have to thank me.

41:31.804 --> 41:34.840
Taking care of him is a task given to me
by Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory.

41:37.470 --> 41:38.830
Thank you for still visiting him.

41:39.500 --> 41:41.990
Jing, you don't need
to be so polite to me.

41:44.500 --> 41:45.740
I had a chat with Dr. Liang.

41:46.250 --> 41:47.440
Right now, Fang Muyang

41:47.690 --> 41:49.320
lacks the ability to live on his own.

41:49.820 --> 41:50.860
Most importantly,

41:51.300 --> 41:53.220
no one knows when he will recover

41:53.226 --> 41:54.826
or whether he will even recover.

41:54.826 --> 41:56.582
He needs someone to take care of him.

41:56.760 --> 41:58.089
However, in Jiangcheng,

41:58.090 --> 42:00.204
there's no one in my family
who can take care of him.

42:00.690 --> 42:01.540
So, I've decided

42:02.090 --> 42:02.740
to send him

42:02.900 --> 42:05.010
to a rehabilitation center
in my hometown tomorrow.

42:09.920 --> 42:10.880
Why?

42:11.050 --> 42:12.210
I can take care of him.

42:12.210 --> 42:13.510
How long can you do that for?

42:14.610 --> 42:15.460
A month?

42:15.460 --> 42:16.370
Two months?

42:16.820 --> 42:18.000
Or half a year to a year?

42:18.380 --> 42:20.460
If he can't recover
in three to five years,

42:20.670 --> 42:22.190
can you take care of him forever?

42:25.680 --> 42:28.650
But the rehabilitation center
in the hometown isn't good enough.

42:28.650 --> 42:29.520
That's a given.

42:32.420 --> 42:33.440
But if he stays here,

42:33.890 --> 42:36.210
the No. 1 Textile Factory
or Educated Youth Office

42:36.570 --> 42:37.830
won't keep taking care of him.

42:39.020 --> 42:39.700
Or

42:41.300 --> 42:43.200
can you take care of him
in my place forever?

42:45.404 --> 42:46.170
Speaking of which,

42:46.170 --> 42:48.420
if he hadn't given you
his university quota,

42:48.420 --> 42:50.071
he might not even get hurt.

42:51.420 --> 42:53.920
Just think of it as repaying him.
Can you do that?

43:01.370 --> 43:02.820
If you can't keep taking care of him

43:02.820 --> 43:04.410
until he recovers,

43:05.250 --> 43:06.510
I'll make the decision.

43:07.004 --> 43:08.400
I only applied for four days off.

43:08.410 --> 43:10.290
I'll leave on the morning
of the day after tomorrow.

43:10.300 --> 43:13.020
Tomorrow, I'll come here
and process his discharge.

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
